1
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:20,920
Have you solved all the problems?

2
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:22,800
Yes.

3
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:23,960
Where are we going next?

4
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,080
Where do you want to go?

5
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,000
I'll go with you.

6
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,120
How about

7
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:28,960
Dali Erhai?

8
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:29,920
Okay.

9
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,880
I know you are Su Muli.

10
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,480
I also know how Su Muchen died.

11
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,400
Now you want revenge.

12
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:11,000
I'm the only one who can help you.

13
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,160
Who are you?

14
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,360
How can you help me?

15
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,840
I can be your shadow.

16
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,720
I can be your eyes and hands in the Lu family

17
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:24,240
without being noticed by anyone.

18
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,880
I need to let Zhou Jian know about the Chinese female fencer.

19
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,680
I need a chance to meet her.

20
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,920
I'm here for a business trip.

21
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,440
I heard that

22
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,280
there is a

23
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,560
a very good female fencer here.

24
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,960
I was defeated by you today.

25
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,360
Fencing is an art,

26
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,440
not a competition.

27
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:40,880
But it's also a happy thing

28
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,480
to meet you.

29
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,520
What's your name?

30
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,600
What a beautiful bracelet!

31
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,240
Why is Zhou Jian?

32
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,560
Zhou Jian has his purpose.

33
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,880
His marriage with Lu Qianqian

34
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:55,000
[is like a cracked glass from the start.]

35
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,120
[It will break into pieces]

36
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,920
[with a little force.]

37
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,520
Lu Qianqian is looking for you.

38
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,640
Tell her I'm in the bathroom.

39
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,800
[I've placed the bug in the frame]

40
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,760
[as you instructed.]

41
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,480
Now, I just await Zhou Jian and the Lu family.

42
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,920
[to fall into the trap I've set up.]

43
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,680
So,

44
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,920
[those so-called designers]

45
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,760
[don't know me as well as you do.]

46
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,200
[I've decided]

47
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,440
[to let Jiang Li]

48
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,280
[design my wedding dress.]

49
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,320
[I believe]

50
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,600
[Jiang Li will make me]

51
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,040
[the most dazzling bride.]

52
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,520
Go to school first.

53
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,840
I'll play with you

54
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,000
after you get back.

55
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,320
[Lu Qianqian has found out about the perfume.]

56
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,320
[Your plan can move to the next stage.]

57
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,000
[In your script,]

58
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,200
[Lu Xu and Li Xiaorou]

59
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,040
[should make their appearance.]

60
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,400
[The plot of Dark Fairy Tale]

61
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,760
[is about to reach its climax.]

62
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,120
Yan.

63
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:01,600
Yes?

64
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,040
Take out the autumn clothes from my cloakroom

65
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:04,880
and iron them.

66
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,840
and put two pairs of shoes

67
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,800
in the suitcase.

68
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,360
Yes, madam.

69
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:22,680
Li,

70
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,440
this is a present for you.

71
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,240
You're back from Singapore so soon.

72
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,360
What a beautiful dress.

73
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,840
Lefkisitine,

74
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,560
you like this perfume too?

75
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,280
Jiang Li, are you ready?

76
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,600
Zhou Jian will be back soon.

77
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,040
He knows our secret.

78
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,520
At this time,

79
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,800
shouldn't you

80
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,640
take Mumu to school?

81
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,320
You help me with all your might.

82
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,000
Aren't you afraid of jumping into the abyss with me?

83
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,400
I've already been in the abyss and can't get out.

84
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,880
Su Muchen was also involved in my selfishness.

85
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,640
Helping you

86
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,920
is my redemption.

87
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,880
If I hadn't provided Su Muchen with the information,

88
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,160
maybe

89
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,680
she wouldn't have died.

90
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,840
On the night of my sister's accident,

91
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:41,040
did Zhou Jian really hesitate

92
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,920
to save her?

93
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,720
After Su Muchen had the accident,

94
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,720
Zhou Jian rushed to the scene immediately.

95
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,120
She was still alive at that time.

96
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,880
But when Zhou Jian picked up the phone

97
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,160
and was about to call the police,

98
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,560
he hesitated.

99
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,640
Someone had a car accident.

100
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,120
Save him.

101
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,480
How did you know?

102
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,040
Because

103
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:17,200
I was the second one to arrive at the scene.

104
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,920
Liu Yanyan,

105
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,040
I always feel you are not as simple as you appear.

106
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Who is

107
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,360
your enemy?

108
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,920
My enemy is the same as yours.

109
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:29,760
[the Lu family,]

110
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,560
[the Yao family,]

111
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,480
[and]

112
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,000
[the Shen family]

113
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,800
[from Wensheng Group.]

114
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,360
You've been hovering around me for ages,

115
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,960
just making tea for me.

116
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,360
If you have something to say,

117
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,320
just say it.

118
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,600
You've always set the rule

119
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,280
that the Shen Family

120
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,040
shouldn't get involved in Golden Thread.

121
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,040
Now I think

122
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,600
you must have known

123
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,760
Annie would end up like this.

124
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,560
But

125
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,960
you're too indulgent

126
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,760
to Jingmo.

127
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,920
Rules are dead,

128
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,480
but people are alive.

129
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,360
Whether to break them

130
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,360
or how to break them

131
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,960
is up to you young folks.

132
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,480
I'm

133
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,440
almost half in the ground,

134
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,560
just a few strands of hair left breathing.

135
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,800
If I were to meddle in everything,

136
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,160
I'd be powerless to do so.

137
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,080
You,

138
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,560
are being overly modest.

139
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,160
Everyone knows

140
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,400
you're the most powerful hunter

141
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,320
in this city.

142
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,480
Even the wolves in the forest

143
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,600
would go out of their way to avoid you.

144
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:01,880
Xiaowan,

145
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,720
after Shen Zhong's death,

146
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,520
technically,

147
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,240
you and Xiao Chu

148
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:09,160
shouldn't have stayed in the core circle.

149
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:12,240
Do you know why I kept you by my side?

150
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,720
How could I

151
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,640
understand your intentions?

152
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,200
When I was 16,

153
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,040
my father gave me

154
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,120
a silver ring

155
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,720
as my capital.

156
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,560
Step by step,

157
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,320
I got where I am today.

158
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,560
What did I rely on?

159
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,600
Not luck,

160
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,680
but ambition.

161
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,400
and a huge ambition.

162
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,760
I kept you by my side

163
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,720
because I see your ambition.

164
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,440
In Shen Family,

165
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,280
only the fittest survive.

166
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,760
If you're capable,

167
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:52,320
hold everything of Shen Family

168
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:54,120
in your own hands,

169
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:54,920
then

170
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,200
it will be yours.

171
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,680
If you don't have the ability,

172
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,400
just be content

173
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,960
to be a stepping stone

174
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,440
for the true heir of the Shen Family.

175
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,640
So,

176
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,800
is this a test

177
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,480
or your true thoughts?

178
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,480
Are you serious?

179
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,240
I won't help Jingmo,

180
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,120
nor will I help you.

181
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,600
Whoever is more capable

182
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,600
whoever wins in the end

183
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,720
will be qualified

184
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:21,920
to take over the Shen Family.

185
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,160
Jingmo

186
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,800
dares to trade Ruisheng Technology,

187
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,520
which he founded, for the Golden Thread

188
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,120
to win a smile from a beauty.

189
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,280
That's his determination and courage.

190
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,520
What about you?

191
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:37,800
Zhuang Wan,

192
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,760
in the face of his determination,

193
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:43,000
to face his determination?

194
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,120
If you dare,

195
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,400
you have the right to be on the table

196
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,920
to compete with me.

197
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:49,920
OK.

198
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,480
With your words,

199
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,400
I can break the rules

200
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,440
with confidence.

201
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,880
Go ahead.

202
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,400
Anyway,

203
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,640
when I close my eyes

204
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,080
and kick the bucket,

205
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,440
all I'll have left is a small piece of land.

206
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:12,320
Whether you squander the Shen Family's fortune

207
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:15,080
or take it to greater heights,

208
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,280
it'll have

209
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,520
nothing to do

210
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,240
with me.

211
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:20,960
Ah.

212
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,040
Then you just keep fishing.

213
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:25,960
I'll go

214
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,880
handle something.

215
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:27,880
Okay.

216
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:28,640
Go ahead.

217
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:29,440
Well,

218
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,680
ask Mr. Xiao

219
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,400
to bring me some new bait.

220
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,440
The fish here

221
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,160
are picky.

222
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:34,760
Okay.

223
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:35,240
Got it.

224
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:08,920
Hello?

225
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,400
Have you decided?

226
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
I can help you

227
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,600
get Shen Jingmo back

228
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,080
from Jiang Li.

229
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:17,760
In exchange,

230
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,240
I need you to use

231
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,120
all the resources of Hongshou Insurance

232
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,760
to help me

233
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:23,880
regain control

234
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,600
of Golden Thread at all costs.

235
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:27,840
Alright.

236
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,040
I promise you.

237
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,560
As long as you give me what I want,

238
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,320
you can get what you want.

239
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:34,760
Okay.
